{"id":"34a7e79edd9f7f6e","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Gaussian Measure Schema","display":"df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema — ZFC Measure9 Gaussian Measure Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema — ZFC Measure9 Gaussian Measure Schema","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-gaussian-measure-schema — ZFC Measure9 Gaussian Measure Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04d24c4f69f28d75\" href=\"?note=04d24c4f69f28d75\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure.md\">58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"084076b1e347ab30\" href=\"?note=084076b1e347ab30\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md\">../batch19/58-df-exponential.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\langle X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\rangle\">\\(H=\\langle X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\rangle\\)</span> (real locally convex space code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*\">\\(H^*\\)</span> (candidate continuous dual), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (Borel probability-measure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\tau(X)\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\tau(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebras)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S\\)</span> (complex-valued characteristic-function predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}probability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}(\\nu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\nu)\n\\land\\exists\\iota,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\iota(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\n\\phi,\\iota;\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\nu)\n\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\phi(t)=\\exp(itm-vt^2/2)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}probability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}(\\nu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\nu)\n\\land\\exists\\iota,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\iota(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\n\\phi,\\iota;\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\nu)\n\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\phi(t)=\\exp(itm-vt^2/2)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}measure\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S(\\mu,H,H^*)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,\\mathcal B_X\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nH=\\langle X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal B_X=\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land H^*=\n\\Bigl\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^X:\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\ell(x+_Xy)=\\ell(x)+\\ell(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\ell(a\\cdot_Xx)=a\\ell(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\n(\\ell,X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\ell\\in H^*\\;\\exists\\nu_\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\n(\\nu_\\ell,\\ell,X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}(\\nu_\\ell)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}measure\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9GaussianMeasureSchema}_S(\\mu,H,H^*)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,\\mathcal B_X\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nH=\\langle X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal B_X=\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land H^*=\n\\Bigl\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^X:\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\ell(x+_Xy)=\\ell(x)+\\ell(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\ell(a\\cdot_Xx)=a\\ell(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\n(\\ell,X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\ell\\in H^*\\;\\exists\\nu_\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\n(\\nu_\\ell,\\ell,X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{GaussianProb}_{\\mathbb R}(\\nu_\\ell)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The continuous dual is derived from the locally convex structure instead of being accepted as an unrelated parameter.</li>\n<li>Gaussianity on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> is now stated through the registered complex-valued characteristic-function interface; the earlier use of the nonnegative Lebesgue-integral notation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{itx}\">\\(e^{itx}\\)</span> was ill-typed.</li>\n<li>Requiring every one-dimensional continuous linear image to be Gaussian is equivalent, by the Cramér--Wold principle, to Gaussianity of every finite-dimensional projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"04d24c4f69f28d75","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends